   def log_error(message, exception=None):
       if exception:
           logging.error(f"{message}: {exception}")
       else:
           logging.error(message)
   ```

By adhering to these practices when developing your application, you can create a more resilient and user-friendly environment that minimizes startup errors and provides meaningful feedback during failures.
